  "differencesFromHandoff": [
    "A country outside the Eurostat collection renders the absence panel the States artboard specifies, and still shows the United Nations balance beside it. The prototype showed the absence only for a series that stops; it now also covers a country never collected.",
    "Every dynamic label is placed by the repository's own overlay mechanism in site/visuals/report-shared.js rather than the prototype's SVG text. The canvas runtime wraps an interpolated text node in a span, which renders nothing inside an SVG <text> element, so the prototype's own dynamic labels were blank; the approval permits this substitution and what binds is each label's position, alignment, colour and content.",
    "The accessible table runs to the full represented window rather than the prototype's truncation, as the approval permits."
